# Quantumult X - Apple Intelligence connectivity
# Source: https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555
# Import as FILTER resource. Enable policy override and select your proxy.
# Built-in direct is a fallback, not an unlock policy. No MITM required.
# Includes Extensions, Siri/Search and Private Cloud Compute.
host, apple-relay.apple.com, direct
host, guzzoni.apple.com, direct
host-suffix, smoot.apple.com, direct
host, apple-relay.cloudflare.com, direct
host, apple-relay.fastly-edge.com, direct
host, cp4.cloudflare.com, direct
